                                                "sense_id": "8e0d060a-c378-3808-9ff8-7a78fbe1fd53",
                                                "text": "In her own view, she was most likely predisposed neurophysiologically to schizophrenia in such a way that her psyche could not tolerate the fracturings that others weathered while maintaining a functioning life."
